Ø{"claim":{"definition":"max minus min observed FHA denial rate among listed lenders with >=100 decisioned applications in this metro","eligible_lender_count":3,"highest_denial_lender":{"decisioned_here":154,"denial_rate_pct":21.4,"name":"ROCKET MORTGAGE"},"lowest_denial_lender":{"decisioned_here":107,"denial_rate_pct":4.7,"name":"GUILD MORTGAGE COMPANY"},"metric":"intra_metro_lender_denial_gap","note":"Derived statistic; does not appear in raw HMDA. Observed rates are unadjusted for applicant mix.","period":"2025","subject":"Colorado Springs, CO metro (MSA 17820)","unit":"percentage_points","value":16.7},"id":"metro-gap-colorado-springs-co-2025","issued":"2026-08-22T00:00:00Z","kind":"computed","limits":["that the gap is caused by lender policy alone","misconduct by any named lender","expected outcome for any individual applicant","that the gap applies to other metros or years"],"source":{"dataset":"CFPB/FFIEC HMDA public record, 2025","method":"https://financeratecalc.com/methodology.html","population":"loan_type=2 (FHA); action_taken in {1,2,3} = decisioned; reverse mortgages excluded","reproduce":{"api":"CFPB/FFIEC HMDA Data Browser API, no key","common_mistake":"Dropping the 100-application floor. Small lenders produce extreme rates on a handful of files and widen the gap artificially. Also exclude reverse mortgages (HECM) â€” leaving them in changes national and metro figures alike.","docs":"https://ffiec.cfpb.gov/documentation/api/data-browser/","expected":{"gap_percentage_points":16.7,"highest":{"decisioned_here":154,"denial_rate_pct":21.4,"name":"ROCKET MORTGAGE"},"lowest":{"decisioned_here":107,"denial_rate_pct":4.7,"name":"GUILD MORTGAGE COMPANY"}},"filters":"Keep loan_type=2 (FHA), action_taken in (1,2,3) as decisioned, reverse_mortgage != 1; denial = action_taken 3. The API has no reverse-mortgage filter: drop those rows yourself.","how_to_reproduce":"Run this against the raw public CFPB HMDA 2025 file. It should return the same lender rates, and the gap is the highest minus the lowest.","if_you_get_a_different_number":"Tell us: ziyetis@gmail.com. A figure we cannot reproduce goes in the public corrections log at https://financeratecalc.com/corrections.html, dated, with credit to whoever found it.","note":"lenders with >= 100 decisioned applications in the metro; gap = highest minus lowest observed denial rate","query_url":"https://ffiec.cfpb.gov/v2/data-browser-api/view/csv?years=2025&msamds=17820&loan_types=2","sql":"SELECT lei, COUNT(*) AS decisioned,\n       ROUND(100.0*SUM(CASE WHEN action_taken=3 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)/COUNT(*),1) AS denial_rate_pct\nFROM lar\nWHERE loan_type=2 AND action_taken IN (1,2,3) AND derived_msa_md='17820'\nGROUP BY lei HAVING COUNT(*)>=100\nORDER BY denial_rate_pct;"}},"value":"16.7pp"}X@Q‘»£*ìùç÷¢	4,¢v!@«`©AşßîëMSêd‰ò	öUïvù“$>é©8nl²ÏˆµğÁ„œb